{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104643","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104643/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104643/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104643/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104643","id":2949059189,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6vxxJ1","number":104643,"title":"PathFollow2D doesn't reset rotation when setting \"Rotates\" to off","user":{"login":"Alex-Onceanu","id":85576612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NTc2NjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85576612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Onceanu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-26T10:15:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T10:35:13Z","closed_at":"2025-03-26T10:34:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in : 4.5.dev, 4.4.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (a77a28c02) - macOS Sequoia (15.1.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 Pro (Apple8) - Apple M2 Pro (10 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen creating a PathFollow2D and toggling \"Rotates\" to ON then OFF, the orientation of every child of that PathFollow2D will be stuck with the orientation of the first segment in the path (instead of having its angle reset to 0).\n\n<img width=\"750\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91840b45-a705-4aef-abff-8383427a9377\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a new Godot project, create a \"Path2D\" node, add 2 points (for a first segment). Then add a \"PathFollow2D\" as a child, toggle \"Rotates\" to \"ON\" then \"OFF\", then add anything (for example a Sprite2D with icon.gd as a texture) as a child of that pathfollow2d. The rotation of that sprite will be stuck with the orientation of the first path segment, even when the path is extended (instead of having its orientation reset to 0).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-path2d.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19464825/bug-path2d.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Alex-Onceanu","id":85576612,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NTc2NjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85576612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex-Onceanu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex-Onceanu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ale